                                    "value": "<div><font size=\"+1\"><b>Gamma</font></b><br><font color='#949495'>Standard gamma correction applied to the elevation values. This\nis a monotonic power-law remapping that shifts emphasis toward\nlow or high elevations, making the overall shape sharper or\nbulkier without changing its ordering.</div>"
