                                    "value": "<div><font size=\"+1\"><b>Weight</font></b><br><font color='#949495'>Controls how much higher FBM octaves contribute to the noise\nbased on local elevation. A higher weight suppresses\nhigh-frequency octaves at low elevations and increases their\ninfluence at higher elevations, producing terrain where fine\ndetails appear mainly near peaks while lower areas remain\nsmoother.</div>"
